  "releaseNotes": "v0.3.0 (breaking): portable models are now lean and unsealed. Customer, Product, Employee, Project, SalesPerson and the sales documents keep only members that another ERP clearly shares; DK Plus configuration, codes, enums, memos, change history and attachment metadata moved to DkPlus subtypes in DevOp.DK.Plus. Removes CustomerOptions, CustomerContactDetails, CustomerItemReceiver, CustomerProperty, MemoPage, EntityChange, FieldChange, AttachmentInfo, the product and project grouped detail models, and Project.RecordId (ErpEntity.ExternalId is the identity). Adds the portable Vendor model, IErpPurchaseResource (IExternalErpClient.Purchase.Vendor) with ErpCapability.Vendors, SalesDocumentParty, SalesDocument.Customer, AmountWithTax and ExchangeRate, and a lean SalesDocumentLine. Consumers that serialize or log by runtime type (ASP.NET Core output formatters, Serilog destructuring) emit provider subtype members; project results to your own DTOs.",
